+test outside `offline-chromium`), of 47. Unit tests of the touched components: 52 files, 513/513
+(`src/features/{home,progress,settings/profile,onboarding,coach}`), and `src/ui/SwipeRow.test.tsx`
+with `src/features/log/reuse/ReuseSheet.test.tsx` 40/40, whose two new tests failed before the fix;
+`scripts/parity.test.ts` 28/28 (no `data-ui` hook a scenario uses was renamed). The only finding
